      <activity id="943b1c84-7aa2-552c-9f54-e63d07dc2762" activityNameId="16ce4937-ec41-5bfe-bf87-20a475831fff" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">EKG I, sanitary facilities, office building, construction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: EKG I, sanitary facilities, office building, construction
Sanitäranlagen Wohnen;
UUID: 4793adc6-8053-35f8-a4f2-3c54f910d6bd
This data set includes the material use for the manufacturing of the sanitary installations in office buildings according to Klingler and Kasser, 2011. The warm water production is not part of this data set. No kitchen equipment other than the sink are considered. 2 office building were analyzed. The sanitary system has a life-span of 30 years. Transport is included. The average energy reference area is 3590 m2.
Location: Data for Zurich, Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4793adc6-8053-35f8-a4f2-3c54f910d6bd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
